{
  "name": "Atendevet: clinic WhatsApp journey",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c83cca1e-a2bd-5caa-8c1f-8e03a33fffa3",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Clinic WhatsApp journey\nThe clinic's campaign stages (Boas-vindas, Triagem, Agendamento) go out on your WhatsApp Business number, and the Atendevet assistant answers whoever writes back, following the clinic's journey.\n\n1. In Atendevet, open *Customizações › Assistente no WhatsApp*, choose *n8n ou outra plataforma* and create the key there (it comes with *Receber avisos de eventos* and *Responder pelo assistente no WhatsApp*).\n2. Add your **Atendevet API** credential to the trigger, and a **Header Auth** credential to *Ask the assistant*: name `X-Api-Key`, value the same key.\n3. Add your **WhatsApp** credential and choose the sender number in *Send stage* and *Send reply*.\n4. Activate the workflow, then turn on the assistant in Atendevet.\n\nA first message to someone who has not written in the last 24 hours needs a template approved by WhatsApp: switch *Send stage* to *Send Template* if that is your case. When the reply comes with `comARecepcao`, the clinic team is answering, and the workflow sends nothing.",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c89bcf23-5612-52c2-a931-c9149df37ffe",
      "name": "Atendevet Trigger",
      "type": "@atendevet/n8n-nodes-atendevet.atendevetTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "lead.campanha.boas-vindas",
          "lead.campanha.triagem",
          "lead.campanha.tratamento"
        ]
      },
      "webhookId": "d3343087-9fe7-57b3-ab33-42fbc2860cf8"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ae7c2e2-78a3-595b-befb-c155ec8aa10e",
      "name": "Send stage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ String($json.dados.lead.telefone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '').replace(/^(\\d{10,11})$/, '55$1') }}",
        "textBody": "={{ $json.dados.campanha.mensagem }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2b2f904b-b89e-5e59-92ec-6e8ecd460dd4",
      "name": "WhatsApp Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ],
        "options": {
          "messageStatusUpdates": []
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "9fb053a6-3a66-5892-97e1-a039f1564ae2"
    },
    {
      "id": "f032c677-1d6b-549a-aee5-9ebef4218d4a",
      "name": "Ask the assistant",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.atendevet.app/configuracao/assistente-whatsapp/responder",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ telefone: $json.messages[0].from, nome: $json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '', mensagem: $json.messages[0].type === 'text' ? $json.messages[0].text.body : '[áudio ou arquivo]' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1ab70c8e-dd99-56e3-b26c-9cbe354b9e79",
      "name": "Has a reply?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "e1dcd773-4a76-5e8b-a882-e57a63051741",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.resposta }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a5b351db-0ccc-5bb8-89c0-3f8d8c01d06a",
      "name": "Send reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        780,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('WhatsApp Trigger').item.json.messages[0].from }}",
        "textBody": "={{ $json.resposta }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
